## 3. Meson configure (BLOCKED — host packaging, not a patch bug)

`meson setup` with `-Dgallium-drivers=panfrost,softpipe -Dllvm=disabled ...`
fails at meson.build:1046 `CLC requires LLVM`: panfrost in
with_driver_using_cl forces with_clc on, and with_clc demands LLVM +
LLVMSPIRVLib. With LLVM enabled, configure then fails at meson.build:2115
`Dependency "LLVMSPIRVLib" not found` (spirv-llvm-translator not installed;
no root to install). Fix: install spirv-llvm-translator matching LLVM 23.1.x
and re-run code/gpu31/mesa/aarch64-panfrost-build.sh. llvmpipe was
deliberately NOT used (requires LLVM too); softpipe is the LLVM-free GL
fallback for the device recipe.

## 4. Selftest / proof compiles (BLOCKED — broken host toolchain includes)

Host `gcc`/`cc` fails on `#include <stdio.h>` (`stdio: No such file or
directory`) despite /usr/include/stdio.h existing; trivial no-include
translation units compile. So neither slot-proof/slot-proof.c nor the
v52 selftest could be compiled here. Both are small, -Werror-clean by
inspection (selftest uses only <assert.h>/<stdio.h>/<stdint.h> +
panfrost_drm.h + the compat header). Re-run: `cc -O2 -Wall -Wextra
-Werror -o slot-proof slot-proof.c && ./slot-proof` on a healthy host,
and the recipe runs v52-compat-selftest under qemu-aarch64.

